  <!-- WebUi 빌드타임 페이지 생성: 셸+프로필 머지/축소/gzip은 VagabondK.nF.WebUi(소스 생성기)가 수행. -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\Source\Web\VagabondK.nF.WebUi\VagabondK.nF.WebUi.csproj"
                      OutputItemType="Analyzer" ReferenceOutputAssembly="false" SkipGetTargetFrameworkProperties="true" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="WebUi\shell.html" />
    <None Include="WebUi\profile.html" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <WebUiShell>$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)WebUi\shell.html</WebUiShell>
    <WebUiProfile>$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)WebUi\profile.html</WebUiProfile>
    <WebUiNamespace>VagabondK.nF.Web.Sample</WebUiNamespace>
    <WebUiClassName>WebPage</WebUiClassName>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <Import Project="..\..\..\Source\Web\VagabondK.nF.WebUi\VagabondK.nF.WebUi.targets" />
